; name: Laser box
; description: An open-top finger-jointed box for a laser cutter, 150 × 100 × 70 mm in 4 mm plywood: no dogbones, parts 3 mm apart, outlines grown by half the kerf (0.15 mm, typical of a 70 W-class diode in 4 mm ply). Export the “all” shape as SVG for LightBurn (kerf offset 0 there). Measure your sheet and set materialThickness; tune kerf and play for the fit.
; 
